         "worked_solution": [
            {
               "text": "Let u = x^2 + 4, so du = 2x dx; the limits x = 0 and x = sqrt(5) become u = 4 and u = 9.",
               "latex": "\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{5}} x\\sqrt{x^{2} + 4}\\,dx = \\frac{1}{2}\\int_{4}^{9} \\sqrt{u}\\,du"
