               "text": "Antidifferentiate.",
               "latex": "\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\sqrt{u}\\,du = \\frac{1}{3}u^{3/2} + C"
            },
            {
               "text": "Evaluate at the new limits.",
               "latex": "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(9^{3/2} - 4^{3/2}\\right) = \\frac{1}{3}(27 - 8) = \\frac{19}{3}"
            }
